        "english": "Sheesh, people should STAHHP making up ridiculous stories about Djalls. One smile and people will screech: \"SHUT UP AND TAKE MY WALLET!\" Really? Oh, puh-lease. If that were true... Endmin, keep still and look at my face! Now ... feeling any uncontrollable urge to gimme all your cash?",
