        "english": "Pro ... motion? Ah, I get it! We have similar ceremonies back in the clan, though I've never actually experienced one myself. You know what? This isn't ... half bad.",
        "japanese": "昇進……？あ、クランにも似てる儀式がありました！1回もやったことないんですけど……思ったより、悪くないかも……？",
