        "operatorId": "endfield:chr_0028_wulfa",
        "fileCode": "chr_0028_wulfa_chrup_promt02_01",
        "displayCode": "EN / 10",
        "label": "Operator Promotion 2",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Hehe, I'm doing pretty well, right? Gotta be this good to shoulder the clan's responsibilities. After all, I'm gonna make the Pack famous across Talos-II!",
        "japanese": "えへへ……アタシ、結構頑張ってますよね？これくらいできなきゃ狼群だって背負えない……狼群を率いて、タロⅡで名を上げてみせますから！",
