        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "C'mon, I'm still good to go...! Fine, if you say so.",
        "japanese": "構うな。平気だと言っている！……わかった、言う通りにしよう。",
        "audioUrl": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/en/char/chr_0031_mifu/chr_0031_mifu_interact_rest_01.mp3",
