        "label": "Operation Prep 1",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Hi, Endmin. Oh, the weather is so lovely today.",
        "japanese": "管理人、ヤッホ～！今日、すごくいい天気だよ！",
        "audioUrl": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/en/char/chr_0013_aglina/chr_0013_aglina_chrbark_squad_01.mp3",
        "playbackMode": "audio"
