        "fileCode": "chr_0016_laevat_chrbark_gear_01",
        "displayCode": "EN / 06",
        "label": "Switching Gear",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "The weight won't slow down my attacks. Flame-resistant coating? Pfft.",
        "japanese": "この程度の重さ、剣を振るのに支障はない。耐火層？余計なことを。",
