        "label": "Operator Promotion 2",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "So, does this promotion mean ... I can get a bigger lab?",
        "japanese": "まーた昇進したんだし、もっと広い実験室に移ってもバチ当たんなくない？",
        "audioUrl": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/en/char/chr_0017_yvonne/chr_0017_yvonne_chrup_promt02_01.mp3",
