        "displayCode": "EN / 45",
        "label": "Unexplored Area Detected",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "My combat outfit is reacting to something. Is there an anomaly over there?",
        "japanese": "戦闘服が反応して……あっちで何か起こっているのでしょうか……？",
        "audioUrl": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/en/char/chr_0026_lastrite/chr_0026_lastrite_explore_find_locked_01.mp3",
