        "label": "Switching Weapon",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Wow. This is pretty sleek. But I can also use standard issue weaponry to unleash a healthy dose of whoop-ass.",
        "japanese": "ん？こんないいやつじゃなくて、普通のでいいよ。相手、腰抜かしちゃうかもだし。",
