        "displayCode": "EN / 05",
        "label": "Switching Weapon",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Wonderful performance! And it's also usable in extreme environments!",
        "japanese": "すごく性能がいいね。どんな環境でも頼りになるはずだよ！",
