        "displayCode": "EN / 02",
        "label": "Operation Prep 2",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "We can't waste food like this — YO! Good to see you here!",
        "japanese": "食べ物を粗末にしちゃいけねェ――ん、何か用か？",
