        "displayCode": "EN / 03",
        "label": "Adding to Team 1",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Finally a place to stretch my limbs! Care to check out my skills?",
        "japanese": "やっぱりここが落ち着くねェ。オレの腕前、見せてやるぜい！",
