        "fileCode": "chr_0018_dapan_chrbark_join_02",
        "displayCode": "EN / 04",
        "label": "Adding to Team 2",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "If you're the one calling the shots, I'll be right behind you.",
        "japanese": "おめえが決めたことならよう、安心してやれるぜ。",
