        "fileCode": "chr_0018_dapan_chrbark_weap_01",
        "displayCode": "EN / 05",
        "label": "Switching Weapon",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Hooo. This piece is well-balanced. You must have spent a fortune on it.",
        "japanese": "おっ、こいつは使いやすいねェ。用意してくれて、ありがとよ！",
