        "fileCode": "chr_0018_dapan_chrbark_gear_01",
        "displayCode": "EN / 06",
        "label": "Switching Gear",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Haven't been fully decked out for a while. HGNH! AHH! Well, what do you think? Looks pretty good, right?",
        "japanese": "久々に試着するかァ……ちいとキツいが、見られるな。どうだ？",
