        "label": "Topic: Fluorite",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "I consider Fluorite to be a fellow scaley friend of mine, to some degree. I find her strong, powerful tail attractive but she forbade me from making tactile assessments. Fluorite is also an artful conversationalist. I can learn much from her.",
