        "displayCode": "EN / 08",
        "label": "Watching Combat Records",
        "category": "Battle",
        "english": "So many battle records... Endfield sure lives up to the \"Industries\" part.",
        "japanese": "作戦記録の数……さすがエンドフィールド「工業」ってわけね。",
