        "english": "Looks like the real work's just getting started.",
        "japanese": "楽な仕事だけじゃなくなりそう？",
        "audioUrl": "https://static.warfarin.wiki/v3/audio/en/char/chr_0022_bounda/chr_0022_bounda_chrup_promt01_01.mp3",
